ouple of decisions that  you can make along the way if you at the  point where like okay which system  should I use it's basically a  reiteration of the slide that we saw  earlier where you basically can ask  yourself a couple of questions in terms  of your data structures if not you can  go to cloud storage if you need a mobile  sdk you can go to firebase and use  firebase storage to have like all the  integrations with ios and android and a  lot of web SDKs now if your data is  actually structured and you want to do  analytics on top of it  then you're looking more to the things  like cloud BigTable and bigquery if you  don't like know your primary workload  it's not analytical then you make the  decision between relational versus non  relational right in the relational case  you go to cloud SQL or spanner and the  non-relational case you go to cloud  datastore or firebase DB and with that  I'm done with my talk and thank you very  much for your attention  [Applause]  [Music]

